[ar:aarav_kharade1234]
[ti:The Light You Left On]
[al:Bringing the world back]

[00:01.81]Everybody left.
[00:05.57]Funny...
[00:11.10]The room still feels crowded.
[00:17.70]There's a cup beside the window
[00:20.97]Someone forgot their coat
[00:23.98]A chair is facing sideways
[00:26.22]Like it's waiting for a joke
[00:28.82]The clock is running normally
[00:31.20]The world has carried on
[00:33.42]But something in this little room
[00:35.13]Refuses to be gone
[00:37.40]There's a fingerprint on the glass
[00:39.62]A crease across the chair
[00:41.98]Little pieces of somebody
[00:44.48]That somehow stayed in there
[00:47.04]And I...
[00:49.46]I don't know why
[00:55.93]But I keep looking
[00:57.46]At the things you didn't take
[00:59.42]And I...
[01:02.18]I can't explain
[01:05.98]Why an empty room
[01:10.33]Can feel so wide awake
[01:17.35]I found an old photograph
[01:18.54]Behind a drawer last night
[01:20.09]Nobody looked important
[01:21.39]Nobody looked famous
[01:22.68]Nobody looked ready
[01:24.33]For the years that came
[01:25.52]There was a boy who thought he'd stay forever
[01:28.11]There was a girl who thought she'd never leave
[01:30.74]There was a mother laughing in the kitchen
[01:33.07]There was a father hiding tears behind his sleeve
[01:36.18]And nobody knew
[01:41.18]They were living
[01:44.78]Inside a memory
[01:47.76]You left the light on
[01:49.96]Not in the hallway
[01:50.76]Not in the room
[01:52.52]Somewhere inside me
[01:54.66]Something still moves
[01:57.73]You left the light on
[02:00.01]Years can go by
[02:00.96]People can change
[02:02.69]But some little pieces
[02:04.59]Refuse to fade
[02:07.39]And maybe that's what living is
[02:10.54]Leaving something small behind
[02:15.86]In somebody else's heart
[02:22.15]We spend our whole lives trying to leave a mark.
[02:25.56]Maybe we already do.
[02:30.08]Maybe it's the person who remembers
[02:31.09]how you laughed.
[02:33.55]Maybe it's somebody who still makes your favorite food
[02:36.05]because you once said you liked it.
[02:39.57]Maybe it's a song.
[02:40.94]Maybe it's a stupid joke.
[02:45.24]Maybe it's just...
[02:50.03]the way you opened the door.
[02:53.03]I used to think the important things
[02:54.67]Were loud enough to hear
[02:57.11]The victory
[02:57.86]The photograph
[02:59.24]The name that everyone remembers
[03:01.90]Now I'm not so sure
[03:04.83]Maybe it's Sunday morning sunlight
[03:07.13]Across an ordinary floor
[03:11.73]Maybe it's somebody waiting
[03:13.56]Five minutes longer at the door
[03:16.26]Maybe it's the stranger who smiled at you
[03:18.81]When you thought nobody saw
[03:21.22]Maybe it's the hand you held
[03:23.87]When there were no words at all
[03:32.05]Don't chase the moment
[03:33.80]Let it happen
[03:34.81]Don't hold the picture
[03:35.91]Look at it
[03:37.34]Don't wait for tomorrow
[03:38.62]To tell somebody today
[03:41.87]Don't wait for the perfect song
[03:43.55]Don't wait for the perfect face
[03:45.35]Don't wait until the room is empty
[03:47.98]To realize
[03:53.13]You were already there
[04:02.70]If I disappear tomorrow...
[04:08.63]Would anything remember me?
[04:12.23]You already did.
[04:17.13]The light you left on
[04:19.27]Was never in the ceiling
[04:22.22]The light you left on
[04:23.69]Was every time you stayed
[04:26.77]Every little kindness
[04:28.25]Every ridiculous laugh
[04:30.63]Every hand you reached for
[04:32.65]Every mistake you made
[04:37.99]And tried to make right
[04:41.77]Every morning
[04:43.94]You got up anyway
[04:55.23]You left the light on
[04:58.43]And somebody found it
[04:59.100]You left the light on
[05:02.58]When the night came down
[05:04.74]You left the light on
[05:07.11]Not for the whole world
[05:10.37]Just for one person
[05:12.10]Who needed it somehow
[05:19.38]And maybe that's enough
[05:22.99]Maybe that's more than enough
[05:28.40]Because we don't disappear
[05:30.60]When the room goes dark
[05:32.86]We become
[05:38.67]The little things
[05:42.22]That someone els
[05:45.28]Carries home
[05:51.51]Everybody left.
[05:55.18]But look.
[05:58.03]Someone left the light on.